WEBVTT

00:03:00.276 --> 00:03:04.596
The second lesson
is about being ambitious.

00:03:05.276 --> 00:03:07.236
In 2015,

00:03:07.236 --> 00:03:12.076
the city council set a target
of reducing greenhouse gas emissions

00:03:12.076 --> 00:03:15.516
by 95 percent by 2030

00:03:15.556 --> 00:03:18.676
without purchasing any carbon offsets.

00:03:18.716 --> 00:03:20.876
So aiming for real reductions.

00:03:21.396 --> 00:03:23.996
Commitment to this goal

00:03:24.036 --> 00:03:25.596
changed our mindset.

00:03:26.036 --> 00:03:28.036
If we were going to reach this target,

00:03:28.076 --> 00:03:30.636
every department had to get active,